1
00:01:19,560 --> 00:01:21,560
Weiyue, you must be tired.

2
00:01:21,920 --> 00:01:22,959
Come and rest for a bit.

3
00:01:24,640 --> 00:01:25,640
Thanks, President Jun.

4
00:01:26,280 --> 00:01:27,280
Whew.

5
00:01:27,799 --> 00:01:28,799
It's so hot.

6
00:01:33,319 --> 00:01:35,840
Hey, this is my favorite Pu'er tea!

7
00:01:38,040 --> 00:01:40,040
You know, I really envy you, President Jun.

8
00:01:41,439 --> 00:01:43,560
Or maybe I should just call you Senior Brother.

9
00:01:45,319 --> 00:01:46,879
I really envy you, Senior Brother.

10
00:01:47,319 --> 00:01:48,640
The moment you transmigrated here,

11
00:01:48,799 --> 00:01:50,519
you got all the memories of this body.

12
00:01:50,959 --> 00:01:51,760
Unlike me.

13
00:01:52,120 --> 00:01:55,760
Even now, I still know nothing about this body's past.

14
00:01:57,280 --> 00:01:58,480
Perhaps not knowing

15
00:01:58,920 --> 00:02:00,359
has its own advantages.

16
00:02:01,799 --> 00:02:04,120
Hmm, that makes sense.

17
00:02:06,239 --> 00:02:07,359
Oh, right, Senior Brother,

18
00:02:07,359 --> 00:02:10,120
I happen to have some questions about cultivation techniques

19
00:02:10,560 --> 00:02:11,759
that I'd like to ask you.

20
00:02:12,879 --> 00:02:13,599
You see,

21
00:02:13,759 --> 00:02:15,159
every time I make a move,

22
00:02:15,560 --> 00:02:16,800
it's all flashy form,

23
00:02:17,680 --> 00:02:18,680
with barely any internal energy.

24
00:02:21,280 --> 00:02:22,240
When you strike,

25
00:02:22,800 --> 00:02:24,039
gather the qi from your Dantian

26
00:02:25,039 --> 00:02:26,479
and focus it onto your point of impact.

27
00:02:34,719 --> 00:02:37,840
This bracelet transmigrated with you too?

28
00:02:39,120 --> 00:02:40,800
Yeah. What about it?

29
00:02:42,240 --> 00:02:43,360
I remember when it was lost back then,

30
00:02:43,360 --> 00:02:44,199
I went to look for it for you.

31
00:02:44,639 --> 00:02:45,360
You told me

32
00:02:45,560 --> 00:02:47,800
this bracelet could help you find your true love.

33
00:02:48,520 --> 00:02:51,159
Back then, I wondered if that person...

34
00:02:56,319 --> 00:02:57,360
could be me.

35
00:03:00,560 --> 00:03:01,400
President Jun...

36
00:03:01,599 --> 00:03:02,560
I skipped lunch today,

37
00:03:02,560 --> 00:03:03,280
and I'm starving.

38
00:03:03,599 --> 00:03:05,000
How about I grab a bite first?

39
00:03:10,360 --> 00:03:11,960
So this is your other identity.

40
00:03:14,159 --> 00:03:15,520
This is getting more and more interesting.

41
00:03:22,240 --> 00:03:23,120
Master.

42
00:03:23,159 --> 00:03:24,520
Here is the information you requested.

43
00:03:25,039 --> 00:03:27,599
Everyone in the sect eligible for the Sect Tournament is here.

44
00:03:34,400 --> 00:03:36,520
Our departure for Flowing Cloud Sect was sudden.

45
00:03:37,080 --> 00:03:38,840
Neither Pei Chen nor Qianning is by my side.

46
00:03:39,120 --> 00:03:40,000
Fortunately, you are here.

47
00:03:40,400 --> 00:03:42,199
This Prince has someone to rely on.

48
00:03:43,360 --> 00:03:44,800
It is Ning Yan's duty.

49
00:03:46,039 --> 00:03:50,840
By the way, are you familiar with that Yuan Qing?

50
00:03:51,039 --> 00:03:52,759
He's the eldest disciple of Flowing Cloud Sect's leader.

51
00:03:53,039 --> 00:03:54,599
But he was away traveling,

52
00:03:54,759 --> 00:03:56,000
and only returned to the sect recently.

53
00:03:59,120 --> 00:04:00,000
Understood.

54
00:04:00,439 --> 00:04:01,000
You may leave.

55
00:04:01,439 --> 00:04:02,000
Yes.

56
00:04:08,560 --> 00:04:10,280
I hope I'm just overthinking.

57
00:04:10,520 --> 00:04:11,159
Yuan Qing...

58
00:04:12,199 --> 00:04:14,919
You'd better just be a modern visitor and nothing more.

59
00:04:18,720 --> 00:04:20,680
Your Highness, Mo Yuya has entered Flowing Cloud Sect,

60
00:04:20,759 --> 00:04:21,480
without his usual attendants.

61
00:04:21,720 --> 00:04:23,199
Our Yuanding and Yinbei have been at a stalemate for years.

62
00:04:23,199 --> 00:04:24,920
Now is the perfect chance to kill him.

63
00:04:24,920 --> 00:04:26,120
If Your Highness wishes to take his life personally,

64
00:04:26,279 --> 00:04:28,040
we can capture him and bring him before you tonight.

65
00:04:37,240 --> 00:04:38,279
Mercy, Your Highness!

66
00:04:38,800 --> 00:04:41,160
Presuming to guess my intentions

67
00:04:41,920 --> 00:04:42,800
deserves only death.

68
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:44,600
Mercy, Your Highness! We will never dare do it again!

69
00:04:46,120 --> 00:04:46,959
Get up.

70
00:04:47,639 --> 00:04:48,360
Learn your lesson.

71
00:04:48,920 --> 00:04:49,399
Yes.

72
00:04:49,839 --> 00:04:51,240
As for Mo Yuya...

73
00:04:52,040 --> 00:04:52,920
To play with him,

74
00:04:54,240 --> 00:04:59,279
I have a faster, sharper blade to use.

75
00:05:05,759 --> 00:05:10,560
Who would have thought I'd transmigrate into the ambitious Crown Prince of Yuanding?

76
00:05:11,360 --> 00:05:14,839
Mo Yuya, I will be your new adversary.

77
00:05:15,600 --> 00:05:18,959
This game has only just begun.

78
00:05:30,319 --> 00:05:31,800
It's really not like the TV dramas.

79
00:05:32,839 --> 00:05:34,879
Senior Brother, how are you so amazing?

80
00:05:35,759 --> 00:05:37,199
In such a short time,

81
00:05:37,560 --> 00:05:40,639
you've already settled in as Flowing Cloud Sect's top disciple.

82
00:05:41,360 --> 00:05:44,240
You're a natural with swords and weapons.

83
00:05:44,680 --> 00:05:46,759
I just happened to arrive here

84
00:05:47,079 --> 00:05:48,399
a year or two before you guys did.

85
00:05:49,439 --> 00:05:51,319
I don't care for all the bloodshed out there,

86
00:05:51,759 --> 00:05:53,120
so I came to this sect.

87
00:05:53,720 --> 00:05:56,360
Not long after, I ran into you and Old Man Ye.

88
00:05:57,399 --> 00:05:59,319
I suppose it was destined by fate

89
00:05:59,800 --> 00:06:01,040
that we'd meet again.

90
00:06:01,759 --> 00:06:03,199
Here, take this.

91
00:06:05,079 --> 00:06:05,920
A hairpin?

92
00:06:17,920 --> 00:06:20,279
Now, sink your Qi into your Dantian.

93
00:06:21,160 --> 00:06:22,639
Use a two-handed arm grip.

94
00:06:25,480 --> 00:06:27,279
Try treating it as your weapon.

95
00:06:53,680 --> 00:06:56,560
These fragments are the host's memories.

96
00:07:06,399 --> 00:07:09,399
This hairpin feels surprisingly natural to use.

97
00:07:10,319 --> 00:07:12,000
Maybe it's because back in school,

98
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:13,000
I loved spinning pens.

99
00:07:15,800 --> 00:07:16,800
Glad you like it.

100
00:07:17,279 --> 00:07:19,000
I once had an old friend

101
00:07:19,800 --> 00:07:21,399
who wielded them quite well.

102
00:07:23,879 --> 00:07:25,639
Among all weapons,

103
00:07:26,680 --> 00:07:28,319
those who wield dual hairpins

104
00:07:28,959 --> 00:07:30,040
are exceedingly rare.

105
00:07:30,759 --> 00:07:32,519
Gu Nanke was one of them.

106
00:07:37,480 --> 00:07:39,000
You think I'm not dying fast enough?

107
00:07:39,639 --> 00:07:41,879
One wasn't enough, you need to poison me again?

108
00:07:43,439 --> 00:07:45,879
This isn't poison. It's a Gu parasite.

109
00:07:46,800 --> 00:07:47,399
Oh?

110
00:07:48,600 --> 00:07:49,920
And what is the meaning of this?

111
00:07:52,199 --> 00:07:53,160
How should I know?

112
00:07:54,120 --> 00:07:55,720
My master just told me to feed it to you.

113
00:07:56,720 --> 00:07:58,160
You have a handler?

114
00:07:58,600 --> 00:07:59,439
Without a handler,

115
00:08:00,360 --> 00:08:02,399
how else would I have learned my poisons and martial arts?

116
00:08:04,240 --> 00:08:05,040
Yuan Qing,

117
00:08:06,319 --> 00:08:09,480
what's your real connection to the previous Gu Nanke?

118
00:08:11,759 --> 00:08:16,839
Don't tell me you're her handler?

119
00:08:27,519 --> 00:08:29,279
Your Highness Prince Rong, given your hidden identity,

120
00:08:29,920 --> 00:08:31,639
you ought to keep a low profile.

121
00:08:32,559 --> 00:08:36,480
Why grace my courtyard only to search it?

122
00:08:42,840 --> 00:08:44,240
Take back your hairpin.

123
00:08:45,399 --> 00:08:46,840
Stay away from Feng Weiyue.

124
00:08:47,600 --> 00:08:50,000
She... is my wife.

125
00:08:54,679 --> 00:08:55,519
Your wife?

126
00:08:56,360 --> 00:08:57,519
As far as I know,

127
00:08:58,039 --> 00:08:59,519
haven't you two divorced long ago?

128
00:09:01,279 --> 00:09:02,360
Oh, right.

129
00:09:02,879 --> 00:09:05,879
I heard you held a second wedding,

130
00:09:06,679 --> 00:09:09,279
but the ceremony was never finished.

131
00:09:11,720 --> 00:09:14,399
Your Highness, Weiyue is a living person.

132
00:09:14,960 --> 00:09:16,399
You and I are rivals.

133
00:09:16,960 --> 00:09:18,600
I know you two were married for a year.

134
00:09:19,159 --> 00:09:20,639
But so what?

135
00:09:22,080 --> 00:09:24,360
Then you are openly courting death.

136
00:09:25,399 --> 00:09:26,240
Your Highness,

137
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:28,399
threatening someone when you can't beat a love rival—

138
00:09:28,399 --> 00:09:32,000
that's considered really low in our era.

139
00:09:32,759 --> 00:09:33,399
Oh, right.

140
00:09:33,879 --> 00:09:36,639
It means completely unpresentable.

141
00:09:46,879 --> 00:09:47,720
Stop!

142
00:09:52,799 --> 00:09:53,360
Mo Yuya!

143
00:09:53,360 --> 00:09:54,919
What are you doing with my hairpin?

144
00:09:55,679 --> 00:09:58,320
And you, Senior Brother! Why are you fighting?

145
00:10:00,679 --> 00:10:01,279
Your Highness,

146
00:10:01,960 --> 00:10:04,960
I know you are possessive of Weiyue,

147
00:10:05,799 --> 00:10:09,480
but I love Weiyue too.

148
00:10:10,200 --> 00:10:11,600
You two are divorced now,

149
00:10:11,960 --> 00:10:12,679
and you haven't remarried.

150
00:10:12,919 --> 00:10:15,840
We can compete fairly and openly.

151
00:10:16,279 --> 00:10:18,360
Coming after me in private, out for blood,

152
00:10:18,519 --> 00:10:19,600
is hardly a wise move.

153
00:10:23,600 --> 00:10:24,399
Senior Brother...

154
00:10:26,360 --> 00:10:27,879
You have feelings for me too?

155
00:10:36,320 --> 00:10:36,960
Weiyue,

156
00:10:38,039 --> 00:10:39,200
don't be so quick to reject me.

157
00:10:40,279 --> 00:10:42,240
We don't just share memories of the 21st century.

158
00:10:43,840 --> 00:10:45,240
The memories of our present,

159
00:10:45,919 --> 00:10:48,039
I will wait for you to remember them all.

160
00:11:07,559 --> 00:11:08,360
Mo Yuya.

161
00:11:09,440 --> 00:11:10,519
What's wrong?

162
00:11:14,600 --> 00:11:15,639
He used poison.

163
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:17,639
His identity is suspicious.

164
00:11:19,039 --> 00:11:19,759
Poison?

165
00:11:20,200 --> 00:11:21,240
He poisoned you?

166
00:11:22,639 --> 00:11:26,240
How else could this Prince have lost to him?

167
00:11:28,159 --> 00:11:29,000
There's no poison.

168
00:11:29,759 --> 00:11:31,240
From your pulse,

169
00:11:31,240 --> 00:11:33,200
I don't detect any signs of poison.

170
00:11:35,399 --> 00:11:37,320
Come on, so you lost!

171
00:11:37,320 --> 00:11:39,519
No need to act tough, right?

172
00:11:39,519 --> 00:11:41,559
All right, all right, hey!

173
00:11:42,159 --> 00:11:43,320
Fine, fine, fine.

174
00:11:43,519 --> 00:11:45,960
Poison, sure. A little massage and you'll be fine.

175
00:11:48,279 --> 00:11:49,080
Something's off.

176
00:11:49,240 --> 00:11:50,519
Something's seriously off.

177
00:11:51,600 --> 00:11:53,440
Lately, in my head,

178
00:11:53,440 --> 00:11:55,840
why do all these random flashes keep appearing?

179
00:11:56,720 --> 00:11:58,200
What on earth is going on?

180
00:12:01,759 --> 00:12:02,559
Weiyue.

181
00:12:03,399 --> 00:12:05,519
We don't just share memories of the 21st century,

182
00:12:06,960 --> 00:12:08,039
or memories of the present.

183
00:12:09,080 --> 00:12:11,240
I'll wait for you to slowly remember everything.

184
00:12:13,759 --> 00:12:14,240
No way.

185
00:12:15,159 --> 00:12:16,559
I must find out right away

186
00:12:17,360 --> 00:12:18,840
what the original owner of this body

187
00:12:19,399 --> 00:12:20,919
was really dealing with before.

188
00:12:24,080 --> 00:12:24,840
What?

189
00:12:25,159 --> 00:12:27,559
Boss, you want to be hypnotized?

190
00:12:28,200 --> 00:12:28,639
Yeah.

191
00:12:29,320 --> 00:12:30,440
Why?

192
00:12:33,039 --> 00:12:33,600
Old Man Ye,

193
00:12:34,679 --> 00:12:38,279
strange flashes have been popping into my head lately.

194
00:12:39,080 --> 00:12:40,919
Just like you, I want to find out

195
00:12:41,519 --> 00:12:43,360
what memories this original body actually had.

196
00:12:44,600 --> 00:12:49,159
I feel my original body had quite a connection to Yuan Qing.

197
00:12:50,879 --> 00:12:51,639
Yuan Qing?

198
00:12:52,320 --> 00:12:52,919
President Jun?

199
00:12:53,679 --> 00:12:54,799
That's impossible.

200
00:12:55,519 --> 00:12:58,080
You were the Grand Tutor's useless eldest daughter,

201
00:12:58,080 --> 00:12:59,360
living your life in the Imperial City.

202
00:12:59,519 --> 00:13:01,480
While he's Flowing Cloud Sect's head disciple, out in the world.

203
00:13:01,799 --> 00:13:03,000
There's no way you two could be connected.

204
00:13:03,120 --> 00:13:04,200
Exactly!

205
00:13:04,679 --> 00:13:06,240
That's why I need hypnosis.

206
00:13:06,559 --> 00:13:08,080
Hey, hurry up! Do it, quick!

207
00:13:08,120 --> 00:13:09,360
Fine, fine, fine, okay.

208
00:13:11,159 --> 00:13:11,759
Look at this.

209
00:13:12,080 --> 00:13:15,519
Relax your eyes as much as you can.

210
00:13:16,120 --> 00:13:18,960
Enter a dormant state.

211
00:13:19,679 --> 00:13:20,919
Relax.

212
00:13:21,639 --> 00:13:24,440
You are entering deep relaxation.

213
00:13:25,080 --> 00:13:26,320
Your consciousness

214
00:13:26,480 --> 00:13:29,919
wanders freely in the sea of your memories.

215
00:13:30,200 --> 00:13:30,840
Feng Weiyue.

216
00:13:38,679 --> 00:13:39,519
Feng Weiyue!

217
00:13:40,120 --> 00:13:42,279
This Prince feels the need to emphasize this again.

218
00:13:42,960 --> 00:13:43,639
First.

219
00:13:44,279 --> 00:13:47,279
My martial arts are unmatched in this world.

220
00:13:48,200 --> 00:13:49,120
If I claim second place,

221
00:13:49,600 --> 00:13:51,000
no one dares claim first.

222
00:13:51,519 --> 00:13:52,279
Second.

223
00:13:53,639 --> 00:13:56,240
This Prince found proof that Yuan Qing used poison.

224
00:14:05,559 --> 00:14:06,320
Feng Weiyue!

225
00:14:07,279 --> 00:14:08,759
Are you even listening to me?

226
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:11,159
Hey, let her sit down.

227
00:14:12,039 --> 00:14:15,279
Good grief, girl, how did you provoke this King of Hell again?

228
00:14:15,840 --> 00:14:18,159
Don't blame this old man for not helping with serious business.

229
00:14:18,440 --> 00:14:20,480
Right now, keeping ourselves alive comes first!

230
00:14:25,200 --> 00:14:27,399
The Prince Charming of your dreams

231
00:14:27,720 --> 00:14:30,279
is about to appear before you.

232
00:14:30,440 --> 00:14:32,639
He's the love of your life.

233
00:14:32,799 --> 00:14:36,360
So bring out your finest qualities

234
00:14:36,600 --> 00:14:38,080
for this encounter!

235
00:14:38,399 --> 00:14:40,240
Make him feel how much you love him,

236
00:14:40,799 --> 00:14:43,200
and that he is deeply cherished by you.

237
00:14:43,480 --> 00:14:44,919
Oh, Your Highness!

238
00:14:45,240 --> 00:14:47,120
Well, I won't disturb you two any longer.

239
00:14:47,279 --> 00:14:48,159
Take your time chatting!

240
00:14:50,519 --> 00:14:51,159
Feng Weiyue.

241
00:14:51,919 --> 00:14:53,120
There's something wrong with that Yuan Qing.

242
00:14:53,759 --> 00:14:55,039
You must stay away from him.

243
00:14:57,240 --> 00:14:58,080
Hmph.
